WEBVTT

00:06.750 --> 00:12.080
<b>KAEI YEAR 7 (1954)</b>

00:29.250 --> 00:34.880
<b>Greetings, samurai. Buy me for the night, would you?</b>

00:39.330 --> 00:40.710
<b>I'll have to pass.</b>

00:41.330 --> 00:45.330
<b>Please, you must. I'm begging you.</b>

00:45.630 --> 00:51.630
<b>It hurts. My b-body is in so much pain... so, please!
You must buy me!</b>

00:53.130 --> 00:54.170
<b>I will not.</b>

00:58.750 --> 01:03.420
<b>Goddammit! Son of a bitch! Why not?!
Why won't you buy me?!</b>

01:04.420 --> 01:05.500
<b>I'll kill you!</b>

01:08.210 --> 01:11.830
<b>It hurts! It hurts so bad! Goddammit!</b>

01:13.290 --> 01:14.130
<b>My name is Jinya.</b>

01:14.130 --> 01:17.130
<b>Son of a bitch! Son of a bitch!</b>

01:15.000 --> 01:17.130
<b>Would you be kind enough to give me yours?</b>

01:18.540 --> 01:19.750
<b>How unfortunate.</b>

01:21.170 --> 01:24.080
<b>It hurts! Goddammit!</b>

01:24.420 --> 01:26.710
<b>Son of a bitch! Son of a bitch!</b>

01:27.290 --> 01:28.750
<b>I'll kill you!</b>

03:27.880 --> 03:31.040
<b>Seems your reputation as a demon hunter holds up.</b>

03:31.670 --> 03:33.330
<b>Here is your payment.</b>

03:36.080 --> 03:41.500
<b>That girl was a courtesan in Yoshiwara.
Albeit a low-class one.</b>

03:42.710 --> 03:47.130
<b>She was trapped in a brothel,
made to have sex, caught syphilis,</b>

03:47.540 --> 03:50.920
<b>and then got tossed out
once her heart and body were broken.</b>

03:51.130 --> 03:56.630
<b>Before long, she became a demon
who just slaughtered men under the cherry blossoms.</b>

03:59.210 --> 04:01.460
<b>Far too tragic, don't you think?</b>

04:02.000 --> 04:04.040
<b>So you hired me out of pity for her?</b>

04:04.420 --> 04:05.830
<b>More like affinity.</b>

04:06.290 --> 04:09.580
<b>Honestly, there's a good chance
I end up like her one day.</b>

04:10.330 --> 04:12.920
<b>And knowing that, I couldn't just leave her be.</b>

04:13.710 --> 04:17.330
<b>You have my thanks, ronin. Sorry to burden you with this.</b>

04:18.080 --> 04:19.830
<b>What makes you think it's a burden?</b>

04:20.290 --> 04:24.250
<b>My job is all about reading
how a man feels from his expression.</b>

04:24.830 --> 04:29.380
<b>But I must say, you have the look of a lost little boy.</b>

04:29.670 --> 04:31.330
<b>Who are you, exactly?</b>

04:33.460 --> 04:36.710
<b>You can call me Harlot. I'm Harlot the harlot.</b>

04:37.460 --> 04:40.330
<b>Names don't need to be
any more complicated than that, right?</b>

04:42.920 --> 04:47.500
<b>Say, ronin? If I ever turn into a murdering
demonic bitch who haunts the cherry blossoms,</b>

04:47.960 --> 04:50.250
<b>do me a favor and kill me, okay?</b>

04:50.750 --> 04:52.710
<b>I can't pay you, though.</b>

04:53.170 --> 04:55.000
<b>I'm not interested in working for free.</b>

04:55.790 --> 04:58.630
<b>Well, shucks. Aren't you cold?</b>

04:59.000 --> 05:00.670
<b>All right, see you around.</b>

05:08.460 --> 05:09.750
<b>What a strange woman.</b>

05:17.920 --> 05:21.960
<b>There are so many people here! I guess
a divine day of celebration gets everybody out!</b>

05:22.380 --> 05:24.000
<b>Let's be careful not to get separated.</b>

05:24.080 --> 05:24.670
<b>Right.</b>

05:25.170 --> 05:28.790
<b>You know, I can't imagine
letting the guys get a glimpse of me.</b>

05:28.960 --> 05:30.130
<b>Not in this outfit.</b>

05:30.580 --> 05:32.750
<b>Oh, come on. It's a festival.</b>

05:34.040 --> 05:37.670
<b>Besides, none of the guys even bothered to show up!</b>

05:38.170 --> 05:41.880
<b>Well, I know that Jinya-san and Miura-sama
were too busy with work to come.</b>

05:42.330 --> 05:46.960
<b>But it's a shame Zenji-san didn't show up
since he was the one who invited us...</b>

05:48.210 --> 05:53.130
<b>"Every good merchant knows that holiday events
are prime business opportunities, fool!"</b>

05:53.290 --> 05:56.080
<b>My dad really gave him an earful.</b>

05:56.830 --> 06:01.460
<b>Anyways, it's not every day we get a festival
around here, so let's just call it a girls' day out.</b>

06:01.630 --> 06:02.460
<b>Okay.</b>

06:17.750 --> 06:19.710
<b>Summer really is in full swing!</b>

06:20.420 --> 06:23.000
<b>Speaking of, why do they call these "lantern plants"?</b>

06:23.330 --> 06:30.420
<b>Part of it has to do with the bright red color. Some say
the name comes from the fact they look like little flames.</b>

06:30.750 --> 06:35.710
<b>There are many theories, but apparently
nobody is sure of the actual origin.</b>

06:36.710 --> 06:37.580
<b>Huh.</b>

06:37.880 --> 06:41.540
<b>You can write the name
with the kanji for "demon" and "light."</b>

06:42.330 --> 06:48.290
<b>Since the husks are shaped like lanterns, one theory
is that demons light them up so they can work at night.</b>

06:48.290 --> 06:51.290
<b>Oh, quit it! You'll ruin their beauty for me!</b>

06:51.960 --> 06:53.920
<b>Do you hate demons?</b>

06:54.130 --> 06:57.000
<b>You'd have a harder time finding someone that doesn't.</b>

06:58.130 --> 06:59.170
<b>Good point.</b>

07:00.330 --> 07:02.830
<b>I've been attacked by demons twice now.</b>

07:04.000 --> 07:08.170
<b>And I honestly don't think
I would still be alive if it wasn't for him.</b>

07:08.750 --> 07:11.500
<b>Are you talking about Jinya-kun?</b>

07:13.170 --> 07:18.710
<b>We first met about 4 years ago. He served
as my bodyguard, although only for two nights.</b>

07:19.960 --> 07:24.580
<b>When I saw him slicing off a demon's arm,
I was struck by a childish thought.</b>

07:25.420 --> 07:30.710
<b>"Wow, this guy is a master swordsman
straight out of the storybooks."</b>

07:31.540 --> 07:34.710
<b>You're really keen on Jinya-kun, aren't you?</b>

07:34.710 --> 07:37.380
<b>I didn't mean it like that!</b>

07:39.080 --> 07:43.630
<b>I mean, I do think of him like a character from a fairy tale.</b>

07:43.750 --> 07:44.580
<b>Except...</b>

07:45.000 --> 07:46.500
<b>I wish I had an answer.</b>

07:47.250 --> 07:49.130
<b>I'm not sure why I'm doing it, myself.</b>

07:50.040 --> 07:55.670
<b>When I saw him in that moment, he looked far from
being a master swordsman and more like a fragile soul.</b>

07:56.330 --> 08:01.380
<b>So, I realized we're not all that different.
And it gave me peace of mind.</b>

08:02.460 --> 08:06.460
<b>You can't call those romantic feelings.
It would be rude to women everywhere.</b>

08:06.670 --> 08:07.670
<b>Fair enough.</b>

08:08.460 --> 08:14.750
<b>I've noticed that Jinya-kun has a bad habit of trying
to avoid the reality of his own feelings, unfortunately.</b>

08:15.790 --> 08:17.710
<b>Hey, Ofuu-san...?</b>

08:17.710 --> 08:19.920
<b>Pardon me there, ladies!</b>

08:20.790 --> 08:21.960
<b>Can I interest you in anything?</b>

08:22.880 --> 08:24.580
<b>Oh, Akitsu-san!</b>

08:25.170 --> 08:29.000
<b>Hello there, Ofuu-chan. Feel free to take a look.</b>

08:29.920 --> 08:31.130
<b>Who is this guy?</b>

08:31.290 --> 08:34.880
<b>He's been a regular patron of our soba shop
since last year and always orders delivery.</b>

08:35.380 --> 08:37.710
<b>He hails from the capital in Kyoto.</b>

08:39.460 --> 08:43.290
<b>Somegoro Akitsu. Nice to meetcha, lil' missy.</b>

08:43.880 --> 08:47.130
<b>What? There's no way that you're Somegoro Akitsu.</b>

08:47.130 --> 08:47.710
<b>Huh?</b>

08:48.330 --> 08:53.210
<b>Somegoro Akitsu is one of the most popular
and respected metalsmiths of our time.</b>

08:53.290 --> 08:55.170
<b>Don't let the name bother you.</b>

08:55.420 --> 08:59.330
<b>I'm the daughter of a merchant,
so names hold a lot of weight with me.</b>

08:59.540 --> 09:03.330
<b>Are you really selling goods
that live up to the work of Somegoro?</b>

09:07.170 --> 09:09.210
<b>Well, I suppose they're not bad.</b>

09:09.460 --> 09:12.460
<b>Harsh critic. Alrighty, then.</b>

09:13.880 --> 09:15.210
<b>How about these?</b>

09:15.670 --> 09:19.960
<b>Decorative shells! They look quite old,
but certainly well made.</b>

09:20.040 --> 09:23.960
<b>Girls around your age
usually have a boy or two they're interested in.</b>

09:24.210 --> 09:27.830
<b>Just use these shells as a gift
and they're guaranteed to fall for you.</b>

09:28.210 --> 09:30.630
<b>Yeah, well, I'm not interested in anybody like that!</b>

09:32.710 --> 09:35.830
<b>Oh, don't listen to her! She's just being coy.</b>

09:35.960 --> 09:38.960
<b>The truth is that she's into someone
but can't bring herself to say it aloud.</b>

09:38.960 --> 09:40.750
<b>Not fair, Ofuu-san!</b>

09:44.080 --> 09:45.750
<b>Ain't you a cutie-pie?</b>

09:46.040 --> 09:48.330
<b>Let's see. How about this instead?</b>

09:48.960 --> 09:52.750
<b>It's a netsuke shaped like a puffy sparrow.
Pretty adorable, ain't it?</b>

09:52.920 --> 09:54.420
<b>Made it myself.</b>

09:54.920 --> 09:58.960
<b>It certainly is cute! But a far cry from Somegoro quality.</b>

09:59.080 --> 10:00.880
<b>Pretty snarky, ain'tcha?</b>

10:01.040 --> 10:04.080
<b>Say what you will, but I think this
is the perfect fit for lil' missy like you.</b>

10:05.670 --> 10:09.420
<b>Didja know that in China they say
sparrows become clams?</b>

10:09.630 --> 10:11.330
<b>They do?</b>

10:11.920 --> 10:17.250
<b>Yep. The sparrows go into the sea
and turn into clams. Or so the superstition goes.</b>

10:17.670 --> 10:24.000
<b>It's how they explain why sparrows vanish in late fall,
'cuz they went into the sea to become clams.</b>

10:25.040 --> 10:26.080
<b>And so what?</b>

10:26.380 --> 10:31.750
<b>I figured a sparrow would be more your speed,
seeing as how you're too young for the clam shells.</b>

10:32.080 --> 10:34.250
<b>Now who's being snarky?</b>

10:34.540 --> 10:36.830
<b>Hey now, I didn't mean it as an insult.</b>

10:37.000 --> 10:40.630
<b>A puffy sparrow built to survive
the cold is what you need right now.</b>

10:41.130 --> 10:43.580
<b>Just remember, the heart is ever-changing.</b>

10:43.960 --> 10:47.830
<b>Hopefully those feelings of yours
become a right proper clam one day.</b>

10:48.290 --> 10:50.580
<b>Whatever, that means nothing to me.</b>

10:51.040 --> 10:53.880
<b>But since it's pretty cute, I'll buy one.</b>

10:53.880 --> 10:56.880
<b>That'll be 90... No, wait, I'll make it 80 mon for you.</b>

10:56.880 --> 10:59.880
<b>You make it sound like that's not pricey somehow.</b>

11:00.330 --> 11:03.330
<b>Well, I am trying to make a living after all.</b>

11:04.080 --> 11:06.960
<b>Here! I'll throw in a little extra!</b>

11:07.750 --> 11:11.920
<b>Huh? Wait, this is a real Somegoro kanzashi!</b>

11:11.920 --> 11:13.420
<b>How did you get this?!</b>

11:13.540 --> 11:18.040
<b>It's something I scored for dirt cheap.
I'll just chuck it later if you don't want it.</b>

11:18.210 --> 11:19.750
<b>You've gotta be kidding!</b>

11:20.040 --> 11:21.790
<b>Then take it off my hands, okay?</b>

11:22.130 --> 11:24.960
<b>I'm sure this hairpin would be happier with you, lil' missy.</b>

11:26.170 --> 11:28.500
<b>Really? All right.</b>

11:32.040 --> 11:33.920
<b>Anything for you, Ofuu-chan?</b>

11:33.920 --> 11:36.250
<b>I'll have to pass.</b>

11:36.580 --> 11:40.040
<b>Shucks. Got a tight hold
on those purse strings, don'tcha?</b>

11:40.630 --> 11:43.920
<b>Well, thank you. Shall we get going, Ofuu-san?</b>

11:44.250 --> 11:45.540
<b>Sounds good to me.</b>

11:45.960 --> 11:48.880
<b>Goodbye, Akitsu-san. We'll be taking our leave now.</b>

11:48.880 --> 11:52.080
<b>Sure. Enjoy your time at the festival!</b>

12:44.210 --> 12:44.790
<b>What's your name?</b>

12:46.670 --> 12:47.420
<b>Kikuo...</b>

12:58.380 --> 13:00.960
<b>Ah, thank you very much!</b>

13:00.960 --> 13:04.210
<b>Now I can finally sleep easy at night!</b>

13:04.670 --> 13:05.380
<b>It's nothing.</b>

13:06.500 --> 13:08.710
<b>Here is what we agreed upon.</b>

13:11.500 --> 13:12.250
<b>Appreciated.</b>

13:12.710 --> 13:17.080
<b>Oh, that's right! Would you care
to have some of our specialty sake?</b>

13:17.460 --> 13:23.080
<b>We had a really good batch lately.
And it's one that we haven't put on the market yet.</b>

13:18.250 --> 13:21.460
<b>YUKI-NO-NAGORI</b>

13:21.460 --> 13:23.580
<b>YUKI-NO-NAGORI</b>

13:24.460 --> 13:25.170
<b>No thanks.</b>

13:25.330 --> 13:27.790
<b>Oh, shucks. That's a shame.</b>

13:28.330 --> 13:30.710
<b>Now, if you'll please excuse me.</b>

13:31.420 --> 13:34.580
<b>Thanks again! You're a real lifesaver.</b>

13:35.000 --> 13:39.500
<b>I'll definitely ask for your help again
should any new problems arise.</b>

13:46.960 --> 13:48.420
<b>Looks like you came out unscathed.</b>

13:49.710 --> 13:51.920
<b>Interesting. Didn't realize you cared.</b>

13:52.130 --> 13:57.250
<b>Of course I do. It wouldn't sit right with me
if the intel that I sold you led to your death.</b>

14:00.420 --> 14:01.420
<b>Here's your cut.</b>

14:04.080 --> 14:07.920
<b>Pity for the prostitute? No, that's clearly not it.</b>

14:08.630 --> 14:10.920
<b>Something else must be causing
that gloomy look on your face.</b>

14:11.380 --> 14:14.500
<b>I killed someone I didn't want to. That's all.</b>

14:15.210 --> 14:17.750
<b>But sparing them wasn't a choice for you, was it?</b>

14:21.790 --> 14:23.960
<b>By God, you're easy to figure out.</b>

14:24.790 --> 14:26.540
<b>Ah, that reminds me.</b>

14:26.960 --> 14:31.290
<b>There have been rumors going around
about a man who exterminates demons.</b>

14:31.630 --> 14:33.290
<b>And I don't mean you.</b>

14:33.460 --> 14:37.170
<b>He's some kind of spirit medium
who can control shikigami.</b>

14:37.750 --> 14:38.750
<b>Spirit medium?</b>

14:39.170 --> 14:42.330
<b>I hear they use some kinda dog or bird spirits
to take down demons.</b>

14:42.630 --> 14:47.080
<b>But that's just pillow talk.
I'm not sure how much of it is true.</b>

14:49.170 --> 14:50.580
<b>See ya, ronin.</b>

14:51.130 --> 14:54.710
<b>Be careful not to let your rival
steal all the good jobs from you.</b>

15:05.170 --> 15:06.130
<b>Jinya-kun!</b>

15:06.790 --> 15:07.920
<b>Thank God you're here.</b>

15:09.880 --> 15:12.380
<b>Well, Natsu-san has been acting strange...</b>

15:15.500 --> 15:17.630
<b>Natsu? What happened?</b>

15:24.710 --> 15:28.000
<b>Oh, how I have longed to see you, dear brother.</b>

15:28.790 --> 15:29.710
<b>Natsu?</b>

15:30.040 --> 15:36.000
<b>Thank the stars! After all this time,
I have finally found my way back to your side.</b>

15:36.500 --> 15:38.000
<b>What the hell is going on with you?</b>

15:38.210 --> 15:41.420
<b>Please don't! I want to stay with you!</b>

15:45.000 --> 15:48.250
<b>This all started after she put on a hairpin
that she bought yesterday...</b>

15:55.460 --> 15:58.040
<b>She suddenly went very quiet.</b>

16:07.540 --> 16:09.000
<b>Where is my dear brother?</b>

16:13.420 --> 16:14.920
<b>A kanzashi...?</b>

16:15.330 --> 16:18.290
<b>Pardon me, Natsu,
but I need you to show me that kanzashi.</b>

16:18.670 --> 16:20.460
<b>Of course, dear brother.</b>

16:22.330 --> 16:23.080
<b>Thank you.</b>

16:29.210 --> 16:31.960
<b>It's nothing but a regular hairpin... right?</b>

16:32.330 --> 16:35.670
<b>Well, here's an idea.
Whaddya say we just break the thing?</b>

16:36.040 --> 16:38.670
<b>No. We shouldn't do anything careless.</b>

16:39.540 --> 16:41.750
<b>May I have it back, dear brother?</b>

16:42.040 --> 16:43.790
<b>Sure. I'm sorry.</b>

16:48.540 --> 16:49.420
<b>Yay!</b>

16:49.830 --> 16:50.960
<b>Watch it, Natsu!</b>

16:54.420 --> 16:56.460
<b>We just can't help but come here, can we?</b>

16:56.670 --> 16:57.830
<b>Hey, Jinya!</b>

16:58.670 --> 17:00.080
<b>And... milady?!</b>

17:00.080 --> 17:01.880
<b>What exactly is going on here?!</b>

17:01.880 --> 17:04.040
<b>Care to explain this, Jin-dono?</b>

17:04.040 --> 17:07.000
<b>Hold on! Before you even answer that,
we gotta break this up!</b>

17:07.000 --> 17:09.830
<b>What is your problem? Please stop!</b>

17:09.830 --> 17:11.330
<b>C'mon, now. Don't be silly, milady!</b>

17:11.500 --> 17:13.380
<b>Who do you even think you are?!</b>

17:23.040 --> 17:25.380
<b>This is downright crazy. Right, Jinya?</b>

17:26.000 --> 17:26.960
<b>Yes, indeed.</b>

17:27.920 --> 17:29.710
<b>Where did she buy that kanzashi?</b>

17:30.420 --> 17:32.250
<b>We went to the Hozuki festival yesterday</b>

17:32.380 --> 17:35.670
<b>and bought it off a gentleman
by the name of Somegoro Akitsu</b>

17:35.670 --> 17:37.210
<b>who'd come from Kyoto to sell his wares.</b>

17:37.460 --> 17:39.670
<b>Huh? Somegoro Akitsu?!</b>

17:39.880 --> 17:41.880
<b>I guess we start by finding him.</b>

17:41.920 --> 17:45.080
<b>That's ridiculous! You must've heard wrong
because he's long dead.</b>

17:45.330 --> 17:46.500
<b>Wait, really?</b>

17:46.630 --> 17:51.670
<b>Yeah. Somegoro Akitsu was a craftsman
who put out work decades ago.</b>

17:52.000 --> 17:55.670
<b>He was known for combs and kanzashi.
Plus, katana accessories and the like.</b>

17:56.130 --> 18:01.250
<b>His metalwork is pretty famous.
It's difficult for even our shop to get stock of his stuff.</b>

18:01.580 --> 18:06.290
<b>That reminds me, Natsu-san said this kanzashi
was a Somegoro piece when she looked at it.</b>

18:06.830 --> 18:08.460
<b>Then, does that mean...?</b>

18:09.080 --> 18:14.460
<b>You better not tell me that Somegoro suddenly came
back from the dead and is traipsing around as a demon.</b>

18:15.040 --> 18:17.130
<b>Nah, that can't be the case.</b>

18:17.210 --> 18:19.250
<b>How would you know, pops?</b>

18:19.420 --> 18:21.500
<b>Because I've met Akitsu-san before.</b>

18:21.710 --> 18:25.040
<b>He's no demon. That guy's human, no doubt.</b>

18:25.880 --> 18:28.500
<b>That's all I need to hear. I trust your judgement.</b>

18:28.750 --> 18:30.670
<b>Seriously? C'mon, Jinya.</b>

18:31.000 --> 18:34.710
<b>You've never met him, right?
Then how can you just buy into this so quickly?</b>

18:35.420 --> 18:37.960
<b>Well, that doesn't leave us much to work with...</b>

18:41.670 --> 18:45.670
<b>Akitsu. I'm just going to have to find this guy.</b>

18:49.790 --> 18:51.000
<b>Please let go.</b>

18:51.330 --> 18:54.960
<b>Nuh-uh! Not after I finally found you.</b>

18:55.380 --> 18:57.750
<b>I am never going to leave your side again, dear brother!</b>

18:59.040 --> 19:03.540
<b>Sorry. But I have no idea what you're talking about.</b>

19:03.790 --> 19:04.290
<b>Huh?</b>

19:05.710 --> 19:08.960
<b>I don't know why you cling to me.
Or why you call me your brother.</b>

19:09.540 --> 19:11.080
<b>None of it makes any sense.</b>

19:12.130 --> 19:15.790
<b>Why should a bird need any reason
to perch itself by a flower?</b>

19:17.170 --> 19:21.830
<b>It is simple. I merely wished
to be at your side, dear brother.</b>

19:22.750 --> 19:25.460
<b>And after many ages, my wish has been granted.</b>

19:26.170 --> 19:28.210
<b>Now joy fills my heart.</b>

19:39.210 --> 19:42.420
<b>I'm afraid that I must go. Will you watch the place for me?</b>

19:42.670 --> 19:43.960
<b>Then I shall accompany you.</b>

19:46.500 --> 19:49.080
<b>Have no fear. I'll be back soon.</b>

19:50.250 --> 19:51.790
<b>So please just wait here.</b>

19:54.420 --> 19:55.080
<b>Okay.</b>

19:56.000 --> 19:56.830
<b>Good girl.</b>

19:58.130 --> 20:00.500
<b>Sorry, but she's in your hands now, Zenji.</b>

20:01.040 --> 20:01.880
<b>What?</b>

20:10.330 --> 20:13.830
<b>Jin-dono seemed rather accustomed
to dealing with her...</b>

20:14.000 --> 20:15.130
<b>You said it.</b>

20:57.540 --> 20:58.880
<b>Big brother.</b>

21:00.250 --> 21:02.130
<b>Pretty sunset, ain't it?</b>

21:03.920 --> 21:06.830
<b>I'm bettin' there'll be a beautiful moon out tonight.</b>

21:07.380 --> 21:11.540
<b>Which means, it's gonna be prime time
for drinking some sake.</b>

21:11.920 --> 21:14.000
<b>Do you have business with me?</b>

21:14.380 --> 21:17.710
<b>Huh? You're the one who's
got business with me, ain'tcha?</b>

21:17.880 --> 21:20.710
<b>They say you've been lookin' all over for me.</b>

21:21.170 --> 21:26.790
<b>After I heard a big and tall fella had business with me,
I wondered what it was about, but...</b>

21:28.000 --> 21:32.580
<b>The answer to that is obvious.
Since demons only come after me for one reason.</b>

21:34.380 --> 21:38.750
<b>There have been rumors going around
about a man who exterminates demons.</b>

21:39.080 --> 21:42.630
<b>I suppose I should ask. What is your name?</b>

21:43.130 --> 21:44.330
<b>Who, me?</b>

21:48.290 --> 21:49.830
<b>I'm Akitsu.</b>

22:06.330 --> 22:09.630
<b>Somegoro Akitsu the Third, actually.</b>
